# will_refuses — a will proposes nothing off its way, and nothing at all where it cannot be done
#
# Two wills held in the Test Field, pinned to the Test Berry Bush:
#   lockpicking — its lock is the Test Door off the yard. The bush is no step of that way, so thinking
#     on it proposes nothing: it says what it wants and leaves the bush be, without naming the way,
#     which the rewrite took for a resolve with no act behind it.
#   pugilitas — wants to come to blows, and the people are in the yard. Thinking on the bush proposes
#     nothing, and names the man it would strike by his label, never the verb's bare "him": said of
#     somebody else, "attack him" names the wrong man.
#   winnowing — wants grain to winnow, and the test location grows none: no path exists in this place
#     at all, so observing refuses the focus and thinking proposes nothing, both saying that only
#     leaving offers it. (Butchery held this part until a will learned to plan a tool-required goal
#     bare-handed: carrying the hairpin, which the critic may judge for any act, it now plans to slay
#     the goat.)
#
# FLAGS: --playground --skip-childhood --debug --seed 42 --no-encounters --auto-dialogue --grant-mm lockpicking,winnowing,pugilitas --grant-item hairpin --location-type test --location-id 0 --start-area "Test Field" --period dawn --organs encephalon=2

wait
click menu New
wait mode ProtagonistCreation 20
click continue
wait mode WorldView 60
travel here
wait mode LocationInteraction 60

advance 12 180
expect-state will "will lockpicking steps=2"
expect-state will "will winnowing steps=none"

# Not this way: no action, and the way named.
click observe "Test Berry Bush"
choose childhood_memory
advance 12 180
click think "Test Berry Bush"
choose lockpicking
advance 12 180
expect-state texts "I want to pick a lock: to unlock"
expect-state texts "but that does nothing for it, and I leave it be"
expect-no-state texts "to get there"

# Not this way, with a person at the end of it: named, not pronounced.
click think "Test Berry Bush"
choose pugilitas
advance 12 180
expect-state texts ": to attack the"
expect-no-state texts "attack him"

# Not in this place: the focus is refused, and why.
click observe thing
choose winnowing
advance 12 180
expect-state texts "have to leave it"
quit
